/-- Weak-FP Laplacian definition from the standard-basis source formula.

This lower_2 helper narrows the `hweakFpLaplacianDef` leaf left by the
cycle-134 source-pullback packet.  Once the selected weak test is represented as
a real-valued test on the source Euclidean state space, it is enough to identify
the weak-FP abstract Laplacian action with the standard-basis second-derivative
formula; the Mathlib Laplacian source action follows from the compiled lower_1
