    "appendix.tex:493-523 applies DV with nu=hat rho_s, mu=tilde pi_s, and Z=alpha*||v_{t(s)}||^2 to control the moving velocity term.",
    "appendix.tex:526-592 changes from s to t, applies lem:gronwall, then specializes to linear slowdown to reach the main-body theorem bound."
  ]
