/-- Cycle-51 upper packet for the discrete forward-KL theorem skeleton.

This is the post-cycle-50 return to `thm:forward-KL-discrete`.  It checks the
five slow analytic interfaces again, then records the discrete theorem route
as a consumer of the already named EM/Fokker--Planck interfaces rather than a
