    "the continuous finite alpha0-complexity assumption for m_t is reused along t(s), but the alpha0-to-alpha monotonicity bridge is not stated separately",
    "the proof must preserve the factor 2*sigma_eta^(-2)*dot t(s)^2 before the time-change rewrite"
  ]
  lowerPacket := [
