/-- Cycle-54 middle audit of the repeated analytic-interface sprint.

This is source-to-Lean synchronization for the middle role.  It checks that the
upper ledger's five interfaces are actually consumed by the theorem DAGs in
paper order and keeps the lower packet focused on the theorem-useful
Euler-Maruyama conditional-law/Fokker-Planck backend.
