    "DV: theorem consumers use dvVariationalFormulaInterface saldDvVariationSource, SALD.saldDvFiniteLogMgfContract, and theorem-specific finite-log-mgf witnesses; common space, absolute continuity, finite KL/log-likelihood, measurability, and finite log-mgf stay source-cited or obligations.",
    "LSI/KL/FI: theorem consumers use SALD.saldLsiKlFiDensityTestContract and cycle-43 density/entropy/Fisher-chain helpers; zero-set handling, admissible sqrt-density test or approximation, vector Fisher chain rule, and finite theorem-level KL/FI stay obligations.",
