    "Do not change theorem statements, constants, alpha ranges, sigma factors, source labels, or proof routes.",
    "Do not classify endpoint-law handoffs as Brownian construction, regular conditional drift, density, weak Fokker-Planck, or KL derivative proofs.",
    "Keep systematic SLT/SDE backfill deferred until theorem skeleton interfaces remain green."
  ]
  nonGoals := [
