    "Before assigning lower work, explicitly check the five slow backends: endpoint-safe Gronwall, common-space DV with finite KL/log-mgf, LSI/KL/FI density-test and Fisher-chain bridge, continuous Fokker-Planck/KL derivative identity, and downstream EM interpolation endpoint/conditional-law Fokker-Planck.",
